n)\n• 外觀評價： 那層漆黑的黑蒜油（Ma-yu）分佈得很漂亮，與濃郁的豚骨湯底形成了強烈對比。炙燒過的叉燒看起來帶有微微焦香，肥瘦比例均勻，視覺上非常有食欲。\n• 口感預期： 這一碗的味道會非常厚實，黑蒜油能中和豚骨的膩感，帶來一種深沉的焦香味。\n• 建議： 如果你選擇的是「濃厚」湯底，喝到後面可能會覺得偏鹹，建議趁熱先把麵條吃完，再決定要不要加麵來稀釋湯頭。\n2. 招牌原味豚骨 (或加辣) 拉麵\n• 外觀評價： 這碗的配料非常標準且平衡，有菠菜、海苔、筍乾和半熟蛋。湯頭呈現乳白色，上方撒了一些紅蔥頭或蒜酥提味。\n• 口感預期： 這是最經典的九州流派，喝的是豚骨熬煮出的膠質和甜味。\n• 建議： 樂麵屋的細麵非常吸湯，建議第一碗先試試「硬麵」，這樣即便吃慢一點，麵條的口感也不會太快軟爛。\n整體評價與小撇步\n• 加麵策略： 既然來了樂麵屋，記得留一點湯頭！加麵時可以嘗試不同的麵條硬度，體驗一下細麵在濃郁湯汁裡的口感變化。\n• 配菜推薦： 如果肚子還有空間，他們的日式炸雞 (唐揚炸雞) 評價也相當不錯。\n• 環境： 從照片看來用餐環境明亮乾淨，是標準的連鎖店品質保證。\n總結： 這是一頓非常扎實且專業的日式拉麵餐。黑蒜油那碗絕對是今天的亮點，味道重但層次豐富。",null,[0,158]]]],[null,1776750163000000,1776750163000000,"4 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfdjE4YWV3MTFNQ3FIUzkwS2tyZFZHQQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfdjE4YWV3MTFNQ3FIUzkwS2tyZFZHQRoSQ2dzSTA1eWN6d1lRd09pUU1B\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwirrIiIy9KWAxVGoK8BHeRHAWEQ_2MI2wEoDA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7120730244720382805/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhTmxSWE1YaE5SVEZ0VjJ0S1dWcDZTakJXYTNBd1pWWTVWMU16WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7120730244720382805/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhTmxSWE1YaE5SVEZ0VjJ0S1dWcDZTakJXYTNBd1pWWTVWMU16WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7120730244720382805/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhTmxSWE1YaE5SVEZ0VjJ0S1dWcDZTakJXYTNBd1pWWTVWMU16WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7120730244720382805/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhTmxSWE1YaE5SVEZ0VjJ0S1dWcDZTakJXYTNBd1pWWTVWMU16WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7120730244720382805/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhTmxSWE1YaE5SVEZ0VjJ0S1dWcDZTakJXYTNBd1pWWTVWMU16WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7120730244720382805/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZ